"""Product image mapping for the 315 approved products (Step 24).

Keyed by the stable product id used in product_data.py. `dir` is the folder under
assets/images/products/ that holds the avif/, webp/ and jpg/ sub-folders; `file` is the shared
file stem; `alt` is the product-specific alt text. width/height are the pixel dimensions
of the JPG (the AVIF and WebP files are encodes of the same artwork).
build_pages.py merges this into every product, renders <picture> markup from it and writes
it into each js/pages/*-catalog.js CATALOG, so regeneration preserves every image.
A product with no entry here keeps the placeholder card.
Note: the nine Circuit Protection & Switchgear images sit in the doubled folder
circuit_protection_&_switchgear/circuit_protection_&_switchgear/ and their 900x900 size is
inferred from the other 306 products (they could not be opened to measure).
"""

